    ActualBuildFailed %GuiSfntSimpleGlyphRenderStrokeSourceSegmentMetricCheckpointBuildErrorKind
    ActualSummaryReadFailed %GuiSfntSimpleGlyphRenderStrokeSourceSegmentMetricCheckpointReadErrorKind
    PaintStrokeMissing
    PaintStrokeWidthInvalid
    MetricCountMismatch
    LineCountMismatch
    QuadraticCountMismatch
    StorageShapeMismatch

